			"widgets_values":[
				"subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the woman from <Picture 1>, preserving her facial features, hairstyle, expression, and clothing.\n<Subject 2> is the person from <Picture 2>, preserving their facial features, hairstyle, and clothing.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] A 5.00-second cinematic sequence where <Subject 1> speaks to <Subject 2> and then levitates, flying up into the air.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1>: fully_preserved\n<Subject 2>: fully_preserved\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe video is a cinematic live-action sequence with realistic lighting, natural depth of field, and vibrant colors. The setting is an open outdoor environment during the daytime.\n[Shot 1]\nIn a medium-wide shot, <Subject 1> and <Subject 2> stand facing each other. <Subject 1> looks at <Subject 2> with a playful, smiling expression and speaks. The camera slowly pans and pushes in slightly on <Subject 1> as she delivers her line.\n(S1) <d>[Chinese] 你看我飞的高不高 </d>\n[Shot 2] At 00:02.500\nIn a wide shot, <Subject 1> suddenly lifts off the ground, levitating and flying straight up into the sky with a smooth, graceful motion. <Subject 2> stands below, looking up in astonishment, tracking her ascent. The camera tilts upward, following <Subject 1> as she rises higher against the bright sky.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nA gentle outdoor ambient wind rustles in the background. (S1) speaks with a clear, cheerful, and playful voice. A soft, magical whoosh sound effect accompanies <Subject 1> as she takes off and flies upward.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nA light, whimsical orchestral melody with soft strings and a subtle woodwind lift, building up as <Subject 1> ascends."
